# Default-deny: this repo publishes only the generic data-pipeline/notification
# tooling. The trading model, feature engineering, backtests, and research notes
# are intentionally excluded (that's the whole point of this list) so a file
# added later isn't accidentally published just because it wasn't gitignored.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!run_daily.sh
!config.py.example
!notify.py
!dbutil.py
!morning_report.py
!download_finra.py
!ingest.py
!ingest_benchmarks.py
!ingest_prices_daily.py
!ingest_fundamentals_daily.py
